{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1405015-obsidian-shards-of-infinity-style","id":1405015,"title":"Obsidian Shards of Infinity Style","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-07-27T21:02:10-07:00","id":1405015,"title":"Obsidian Shards of Infinity Style","content":"I'm packing my room up for a move and found my old copy of 2e's Scroll of the Monk, and I have to say, damn. Obsidian Shards of Infinity style is the coolest goddamn martial arts style in Exalted in any edition. I hope that it shows up in 3E eventually.<br /> <br /> &quot;it was super broken&quot; I DON'T CARE IT WAS SO AWESOME I CAN OVERLOOK THAT. I will be very sad if I cannot rain obsidian shards onto people or dissimilate into a thousand shards and reform somewhere else in 3e eventually, dammit. Plus it let you hit people's reflections and also just clap your hands and declare &quot;actually, you didn't hit me&quot; and that is just hilariously awesome. I don't mind if it's toned down in some way (let's be real, it <i>is</i> pretty damn busted) but god, the obsidian theme to it is way too awesome to leave behind in 2e. I might have to homebrew my own &quot;regular&quot; martial art (that is, the kind currently in 3e's books) focused around the obsidian theming more than the fate/SMA stuff because to be what really brings me to it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4801,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4801-frostav","user":"Frostav","date":". 07-28-2020, 12:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4801-frostav","name":"Frostav","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-28T01:29:10-07:00","id":1405033,"title":"","content":"Well hopefully, Sidereals will be the Splat Kickstarted after Exigents. I think it was confirmed that they're gonna put some SMAs in the Sid book (What Fate has Decreed?) and maybe Obsidian Shards will be one of them.<br /> <br /> Or maybe there'll be a milestone to put Obsidian Shards in the Sidereal Companion","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-28T03:01:16-07:00","id":1405039,"title":"","content":"I do know SMAs will be in Essence and with the streamlining of the system and the pullback against the <b>massive </b>charm lists it likely wouldn't be too hard to put it together in that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3729-darkfoxdev","name":"Darkfoxdev","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-28T03:39:35-07:00","id":1405041,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1405015-obsidian-shards-of-infinity-style?p=1405033#post1405033\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-i