,"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-28T10:17:56-07:00","id":1405084,"title":"","content":"I need to expensively back something to get Crystal Chameleon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/903-cheshire-cat","name":"Cheshire Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar903_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-28T11:52:56-07:00","id":1405091,"title":"","content":"Goodness knows Obsidian Shards is my favorite in terms of aesthetics. Whatever they make of it that is solid I will probably appreciate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-29T16:18:02-07:00","id":1405213,"title":"","content":"I'd be surprised if Crystal Chameleon weren't in the Sidereal book. And if it's not mentioned, I may be desperate enough to see if there's a backer tier for adding some MA Styles. I actually have a job now","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-29T23:59:46-07:00","id":1405252,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1405015-obsidian-shards-of-infinity-style?p=1405213#post1405213\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd be surprised if Crystal Chameleon weren't in the Sidereal book. And if it's not mentioned, I may be desperate enough to see if there's a backer tier for adding some MA Styles. I actually have a job now</div> </div> </div> </div>Or Sid companion/Getimians.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-30T16:19:38-07:00","id":1405416,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1405015-obsidian-shards-of-infinity-style?p=1405058#post1405058\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Per Vance on the Exalted Discord, Obsidian Shards is currently slated for the Sids book. (The current plan is for Violet Bier, Throne Shadow, Prismatic Arrangement of Creation, Citrine Poxes of Contagion, Charcoal March of Spiders, Obsidian Shards, and a brand new SMA),</div> </div> </div> </div>Any news on Quicksilver Hand of Dreams or Border of Kaleidoscopic Logic? I had a liking for the fluff weirdness of those two.<br /> <br /> Also, i remember reading sometime ago in the forums that Scarlet Patterned Battlefield is gone forever.<br /> Is that a fact or am i imagining things?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T00:47:39-07:00","id":1405497,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1405015-obsidian-shards-of-infinity-style?p=1405416#post1405416\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Any news on Quicksilver Hand of Dreams or Border of Kaleidoscopic Logic? I had a liking for the fluff weirdness of those two.<br /> <br /> Also, i remember reading sometime ago in the forums that Scarlet Patterned Battlefield is gone forever.<br /> Is that a fact or am i imagining things?</div> </div> </div> </div>BoKL is Vance's favorite, so I expect we'll be seeing it somewhere along the way.<br /> <br /> Quicksilver Hand... a 3e version has been mooted, but it'll need punching up.<br /> <br /> They did write SPB off, but as of June this year Neall had ideas for it, so we'll see if anything comes of that.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T04:46:43-07:00","id":1405544,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1405015-obsidian-shards-of-infinity-style?p=1405497#post1405497\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> BoKL is Vance's favorite, so I expect we'll be seeing it somewhere along the way.<br /> <br /> Quicksilver Hand... a 3e version has been mooted, but it'll need punching up.<br /> <br /> They did write SPB off, but as of June this year Neall had ideas for it, so we'll see if anything comes of that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, most interesting news on all of them.<br /> I have to read on Dream Pearl Courtesan while at that, as i remember there being some vague potential hooks between it and Quicksilver Hand's mystery dream sifus.<br /> About SPB i'm curious about the write off (Apocrypha material - yeah, i have some weird, in-setting use hook for the keyword) and its possible return both.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T07:35:00-07:00","id":1405572,"title":"","content":"wastevens' excellent <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/862912-sidereals-where-fate-has-led-fan-project\">Siderals: Where Fate Has Led</a> fan splat has a pretty damn cool version of Obsidian Shards of Infinity, along with Prismatic Arrangement of Creation, Charcoal March of Spiders, Sapphire Veil of Passion, Violet Bier of Sorrow, Throne Shadow, and Crystal Chameleon. No idea how they stack up with the 2e forms, or with existing 3e styles in terms of balance, but they're pretty cool in their own right.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12314-grod_the_giant","name":"Grod_the_giant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12314_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T08:02:25-07:00","id":1405577,"title":"","content":"I use that one and I can vouch for it, it's pretty baller. <br /> <br /> It works under a much stricter paradigm than normal martial arts, though, which some may find stifling.<br /> <br /> <br /> That Obsidian Shards has &quot;copy someone's appearance&quot;, &quot;copy one power they used&quot;, &quot;you effectively have two combat actions per round and halve onslaught penalties&quot;, &quot;draw a clone&quot; and the capstone &quot;draw a clone per round&quot;. The clones can't do much because you share essence pools, but it's powerful even without spending essence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T13:02:13-07:00","id":1405657,"title":"","content":"Just so long as it doesn't have that godawful &quot;All your Martial Arts Charms are free&quot; Charm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}